# Export pages

A topic gets a Client page only when that call runs on the client, and a Server page only when that call runs on the server.

Do not add a page whose only job is to say the call lives on the other side, or to paste the other side's example. Leave that page out.

Each remaining function is a heading, then Parameters, Returns, and one Example. Name a backend only when the call cannot do something the caller must know.
